      "name": "Why this happens",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Your uterine lining releases",
        "prostaglandins that make the",
        "uterus contract hard",
        "",
        "Some everyday foods push",
        "that release into overdrive"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Coffee & Energy Drinks",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "A review pooling 3 studies of",
        "over 1,000 women found caffeine",
        "linked to worse period pain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Coffee — the fix",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Swap for decaf or herbal",
        "tea a few days before"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Wine & Alcohol",
      "char_file": "와인_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Dehydrates the body and",
        "throws off pain signals",
        "",
        "Cramps often feel sharper",
        "the next day"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Alcohol — the fix",
      "char_file": "와인_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Trade it for sparkling",
        "water with lime"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Salty Fried Food",
      "char_file": "가공육_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Sodium pulls water into",
